{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/6537cf651f9fd75c031ca0d4f31e549f.poster.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/6537cf651f9fd75c031ca0d4f31e549f.webm?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/6537cf651f9fd75c031ca0d4f31e549f.mp4?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against waves of alien monsters in this unique roguelike action mining game. Use the time between attacks to dig beneath the surface in search of valuable resources and relics \u2013 deliver them back to your dome to unlock powerful upgrades and useful new gadgets.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be long until the relentless monsters return - do you risk delving deeper into the mine? Or return to base and prepare for imminent attack? The choice is yours, but make it quickly!\u00a0\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/fe23056477fc035752967cac0afc28c3.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your drill and keeper equipment to quickly dig out tunnels and explore the depths beneath your dome. Each run has its own unique, procedurally generated map filled with resources and caves to discover, along with additional gadgets to obtain. \u200b\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/87b6a5b16e396c5c08170b6de0a3695e.poster.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/87b6a5b16e396c5c08170b6de0a3695e.webm?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/87b6a5b16e396c5c08170b6de0a3695e.mp4?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/4f4d4fa0c21a1993b8fea8b0a7bec7b0.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your dome by operating its powerful weaponry to defend against waves of monster attacks. Upgrade, repair and repel a variety of enemy types that approach across air and ground, each with their own unique attack methods and movement patterns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/66617ef866258d9a45c6b5f9b4f148fd.poster.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/66617ef866258d9a45c6b5f9b4f148fd.webm?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/66617ef866258d9a45c6b5f9b4f148fd.mp4?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/a285f4ea84085d89f50ced2c4eb22712.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend resources to unlock useful upgrades. Improve dome defences, enhance the impact of your drill, or increase movement speed \u2013 choose carefully and strategize to increase odds of survival.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/7d0f9bf132abd72b4e2de9c55faa6aaa.poster.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/7d0f9bf132abd72b4e2de9c55faa6aaa.webm?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/966d9776534b95c6899af48702a9d783.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your setup and find a playstyle that works for you by choosing from two unique keeper types, four different domes, and four primary gadgets. Pick a run modifier, adjust difficulty settings and discover dozens of secondary gadgets while you dig through the earth.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/c141de5c54fef9191dcff440b503f688.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=1486 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gifts from the past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/3402ac0d84039e6ecb88a3c554251f930673a925.jpg"},{"name":"Shield Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/0c9434a6b184f7b1c3760edc3a0ce065bf7cc233.jpg"},{"name":"Land of the orbs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/d9a2dcde8164f7a7f82069db90609fa077dc9d1e.jpg"},{"name":"Land of the behemoth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/a7371e2790f30a1e712bd4e293356b9d9ff2a977.jpg"},{"name":"Land of the stalks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/769c38d38c04b74cf228b82eaecd656df84d6e9e.jpg"},{"name":"Land of the Spores","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/51f78ef3ec50de87ba9f2903291b6bf0dfa8c2f3.jpg"},{"name":"Stick them with the pointy end","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/171f0f9c3014aeec773f551f4474a1718c2f6a42.jpg"},{"name":"Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/88776161e60ceaf095aab9130b55646c95da1f3e.jpg"},{"name":"Doping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/51586f8a5636190670d15bc27864ebd97d525bc4.jpg"},{"name":"Quick Finish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1637320/a68daec7140dfc8666513424dcbe409464b309ba.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1637320?t=1770751169","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/252e25ef648b6e28334fe5cb35fb7a5e001d30f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770751169","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/a5c61ad9d7ce869e67256043cf9ca0874f1f3388/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770751169","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/a5c61ad9d7ce869e67256043cf9ca0874f1f3388/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770751169","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1650980,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Check out a friend's mining survivor game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/6537cf651f9fd75c031ca0d4f31e549f.poster.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/6537cf651f9fd75c031ca0d4f31e549f.webm?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/6537cf651f9fd75c031ca0d4f31e549f.mp4?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against waves of alien monsters in this unique roguelike action mining game. Use the time between attacks to dig beneath the surface in search of valuable resources and relics \u2013 deliver them back to your dome to unlock powerful upgrades and useful new gadgets.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it won\u2019t be long until the relentless monsters return - do you risk delving deeper into the mine? Or return to base and prepare for imminent attack? The choice is yours, but make it quickly!\u00a0\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/fe23056477fc035752967cac0afc28c3.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your drill and keeper equipment to quickly dig out tunnels and explore the depths beneath your dome. Each run has its own unique, procedurally generated map filled with resources and caves to discover, along with additional gadgets to obtain. \u200b\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/87b6a5b16e396c5c08170b6de0a3695e.poster.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/87b6a5b16e396c5c08170b6de0a3695e.webm?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/87b6a5b16e396c5c08170b6de0a3695e.mp4?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/4f4d4fa0c21a1993b8fea8b0a7bec7b0.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your dome by operating its powerful weaponry to defend against waves of monster attacks. Upgrade, repair and repel a variety of enemy types that approach across air and ground, each with their own unique attack methods and movement patterns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/66617ef866258d9a45c6b5f9b4f148fd.poster.avif?t=1770751169\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/66617ef866258d9a45c6b5f9b4f148fd.webm?t=1770751169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1637320/extras/66617ef866258